      "title": "Roughtime: Add some heuristics",
      "message": "Roughtime: Add some heuristics\n\nThe commonly used port(s) for this protocol are not officially\nregistered; an official port is due to be registered soon.\n\nIf the first 8 bytes aren't the magic number from the IETF version,\nthen the first 4 bytes should be the number of outer tags, which\nshould never be more than 7. Allow up to 15 for expansion, but reject\nthe vast majority of packets on those ports with bogus values to\navoid malformed packets on other protocols that happen to use those\nports. Tested with the file from !18559, and does not reject any\nvalid packets.\n",
